# {{ package }}

The `{{ package }}` package is an HTTPX2 client of the API the OpenAPI document describes.
datamodel-code-generator generated it from the document, together with the `{{ model_package }}` models of the `{{ backend }}` backend.
Generation overwrites every file of the package, as it does the models: keep your code outside the package and regenerate the package instead of editing it; see [Regenerating](#regenerating).

HTTPX2 client generation is experimental.
The [runtime reference]({{ reference }}) describes the settings, defaults, ownership, cancellation, replay, redirects, and transport costs of the clients.

